      },
      {
        "heading": "Which vendors and industries lead in award dollars?",
        "body": "BRISTON CONSTRUCTION, LLC leads vendors with $14.2M, followed by JETT'S SPECIALTY CONTRACTING, LLC at $10.2M and PAFFORD MEDICAL SERVICES, INC. at $6.4M. The top industries include Water and Sewer Line and Related Structures Construction at $14.2M and Ambulance Services at $5.5M, reflecting demand for construction and medical-related services."
